<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JULY 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 11     July 10   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  276.110     276.280     247.020   11.78 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.500     309.550     306.830    0.87 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.155     157.480     158.970   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.510	46.588	47.182   -1.42 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  468.680     466.000     419.180   11.81 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.580     139.820     141.685   -1.49 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.114	16.116	16.185   -0.44 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  242.580     244.540     212.430   14.19 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.862	 1.863	 1.888   -1.38 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.558	 1.558	 1.581   -1.45 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.905     190.055     183.135    3.70 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
